 - `@avn/ui` 0.1.0: React + TypeScript + Motion components with tests.
 - `scripts/check-style.mjs`, `examples/minimal.html` (style/palette/theme previewer), `board/index.html` (live board).
 - Docs: README, using in a project, changing the UX, adding a style.
+
+## 0.3.1
+
+- Keep dialogs open when using toast actions.
+- Allow viewport-positioned popovers and keep pickers anchored through scrolling and resizing.
+
+## 0.3.2
+
+- NutBot panel: header `actions`, a `view` that replaces the conversation while the composer stays, an `embedded` mode for drawing it inside a dialog, and an app-kept `draft` so the typed text survives the panel moving.
+- Dialogs: `className`, and Escape closes an open menu inside the dialog (a prompt bar's / or @ list) before the dialog.
